[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2700.95, "timestamp": "00:45:00", "text": "だって、私たちはここにいるんだから。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2702.87, "timestamp": "00:45:02", "text": "ニース。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2704.79, "timestamp": "00:45:04", "text": "私もそれならできますよ。 これは広報"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2731.109, "timestamp": "00:45:31", "text": "けど、すごく"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2733.829, "timestamp": "00:45:33", "text": "クールだ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2736.63, "timestamp": "00:45:36", "text": "あ、待って。 私は武器を持っている。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2738.63, "timestamp": "00:45:38", "text": "ああ、今"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2740.63, "timestamp": "00:45:40", "text": "気づいたんだけど、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2742.79, "timestamp": "00:45:42", "text": "私武器持ってるんだ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2745.99, "timestamp": "00:45:45", "text": "よし、彼女にとって一番良いのは、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2749.589, "timestamp": "00:45:49", "text": "下か左のどちらかだ。 必ず書き上げます。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2751.109, "timestamp": "00:45:51", "text": "うん。   何てことだ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2753.51, "timestamp": "00:45:53", "text": "。 待って、刺される可能性はあるの？ 刺してやる"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2754.39, "timestamp": "00:45:54", "text": "。"}]